Package: com.zema.zgta-v.appsync
Name: ZGTA V (AppSync installer - experimental)
Version: 0.91-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: Applications
Maintainer: ZEMA
Author: zema
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<= 18.2), curl, coreutils, ai.akemi.appsyncunified (>= 116.0), ai.akemi.appinst (>= 2.1.1)
Conflicts: com.zema.zgta-v.trollstore
Description: Experimental Build 91 fallback for compatible ARM64 rootful jailbreaks without TrollStore. Uses official AppSync Unified and appinst; add https://cydia.akemi.ai/ for dependencies. Not for RootHide or rootless. Actual app installation and gameplay on this route are untested. Own game files required; removing this wrapper leaves the app and data installed.
